   <crs:Name>
    <rdf:Alt>
     <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">SNIPED_LOCKED_LOOK_v3_LUXURY</rdf:li>
    </rdf:Alt>
   </crs:Name>
   <crs:ShortName>
    <rdf:Alt>
     <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">SNIPED Locked v3 Luxury</rdf:li>
    </rdf:Alt>
   </crs:ShortName>
   <crs:SortName>
    <rdf:Alt>
     <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">SNIPED 01 Locked v3 Luxury</rdf:li>
    </rdf:Alt>
   </crs:SortName>
   <crs:Group>
    <rdf:Alt>
     <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">SNIPED · Locked</rdf:li>
    </rdf:Alt>
   </crs:Group>
   <crs:Description>
    <rdf:Alt>
     <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">SNIPED locked-look v3 LUXURY EDITORIAL · the quiet luxury direction (locked 2026-05-12). Adobe Neutral foundation, restrained presence (Texture -5 / Clarity -3 / Saturation -8), HSL light-hand correction (Orange Hue -3 for skin, Yellow Sat -15 to kill digital yellow, Green Sat -15 for muted greens), Color Grading at sat under 8 (Shadows 215/6, Midtones 35/4, Highlights 45/5, Blending 50), Calibration as foundation (Red Hue +5 Sat +5, Green Hue -8 Sat -5, Blue Sat +12), soft S point curve with lifted blacks and creamy highlight roll-off (0,14 / 35,32 / 128,128 / 205,215 / 255,240), per-channel curves at restraint, subtle film grain (amount 15 / size 25 / frequency 50). Built for Canon R6 II RAWs in the Meisel / Roversi / Mert and Marcus lane, NOT cinematic compositing. Apply via import preset. v2 retained as version history.</rdf:li>
    </rdf:Alt>
   </crs:Description>
